# Normalize all text files to LF in the repo, regardless of each
# contributor's local `core.autocrlf` — prevents whole-tree CRLF/LF
# false-modified noise, and keeps stamp-kit-assets.mjs's content hash
# (computed over file bytes) stable across Windows/Linux checkouts.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary — never touch line endings
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
